{"id":"memorial_101301","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial101300","label":"Memoirs · A Girl's Memoir"},"label":"July 23, XX at 3:00 PM (Rainy)","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"memorial_101302","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_101301_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_13_01_description","text":"I left the house."},{"id":"memorial_101301_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_13_01_description","text":"It wasn't my idea, as Daddy actually proposed it."},{"id":"memorial_101301_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_13_01_description","text":"He said he had never taken me on any trips before because we were too poor then."},{"id":"memorial_101301_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_13_01_description","text":"This time, he would bring me somewhere wonderful."},{"id":"memorial_101301_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_13_01_description","text":"It was one of the happiest days of my life."}]}